{
  "_about": "Module F global allowlist. Only these apps can receive dictated text and a send. Package names are unconfirmed until checked on the phone: open the app and run `python3 -m module_f learn <Name>` to save its real package to ~/.module-f/allowlist.local.json, which overrides this file.",
